.KEY x
.BRA {
.KET }
;
; btwatch -- capture the Bluetooth error log to the card, and tick on both.
;
; Every other probe here reports through DEBUG: because that reaches the
; serial line. This one uses both: the heartbeat goes to DEBUG: AND to the
; card, the error-log dump only to the card. On this board serial output
; stops somewhere around the Wanderer takeover (2026-08-26, cause not yet
; known), so the card is the channel we trust -- but the last tick to reach
; serial dates that failure, which is worth having.
;
; Detached, so the Startup-Sequence continues and Wanderer still starts.
;
Run >NIL: Execute "S:btwatch-loop"
